// Detection — WorldView IOC match against named ICS threat actor
//
// Fires when Dragos has matched activity to a named threat group from
// the WorldView intel feed (ELECTRUM, VOLTZITE, CHERNOVITE, KAMACITE,
// XENOTIME, etc.). These are the highest-fidelity alerts in the platform
// because they imply a direct correlation to known adversary infrastructure
// or TTPs.
//
// Suggested rule cadence: every 5 minutes, lookback 10 minutes.
// Suggested severity: High or Critical.
//
// Depends on: Dragos_Events parser

Dragos_Events
| where TimeGenerated > ago(10m)
| where isnotempty(WorldViewActor)
| project TimeGenerated, Activity, Severity, WorldViewActor,
          SourceIP, DestinationIP, SrcAssetRole, DstAssetRole,
          MitreIcsTechnique, DragosCaseId, Message
| order by TimeGenerated desc
